{"job_id":"F-4926a6cad9de59be191a","family_id":"F-4926a6cad9de59be191a","title":"효행 장려 및 지원에 관한 법률","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":17,"target_id":"5b9093a762efc821bcaa841b6de387882b6d3fcaa60bd5da0efef23aaecdadc4","source_hash":"9a51a949e98889729481007b7d0eda7e5d08b409f3b614397a31b1188a3239ba","text":"促进和支持孝道法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"96b1328d11e41f35b29d052ed9b81a58db32b31bbe385d687e7a77dd51ddd919","source_hash":"936838281cb39bbbae8a4860b7451d4f9faebcce63277d98ffdb8c23a6992fc8","text":"第一章 总则\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8,"end":134,"target_id":"0ad020a2b83561c89b88935bc14fe0570dc9b12abd71d33a5bddf5ce6b51071b","source_hash":"4ce078f2f6810e2b62bc142353ebe39bfd94ac335f606281737b76116473d76e","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的在于，通过在全国范围内弘扬孝道这一美好的传统文化遗产，为世界文化的发展做出贡献，并为国家发展提供动力，从而不仅通过孝道行为解决老龄化社会面临的问题，而且确保这种行为为国家进步提供动力。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":134,"end":400,"target_id":"56e8fe2355cd4528ab76845425596c0fd816af66c91a6030847747e4b0eba43f","source_hash":"e76212dc4d92f94696bc2dcd39b04f79197280fb3b34cd37a52ecd768d39f9a8","text":"第二条（定义）本法中使用的术语定义如下。\n1. “孝道”是指子女忠实地供养父母并履行相应的义务。\n2.“孝行”指的是孝道的实践。\n3。“父母等”是指《民法》第 777 条中亲属定义的长辈。\n4.“敬老”的意思是尊敬长辈。\n“孝道文化”是指通过教育、文学、艺术、音乐、戏剧、电影、韩国传统音乐等与孝道和尊敬长辈相关的途径所形成的有关孝道和尊敬长辈的社会价值观。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":400,"end":488,"target_id":"1b6b5ce61a84a995edae199ddbc3b428ca1075c2c915f4e2bfbbbe309b319e4a","source_hash":"3f81d542a6c20bc28894e0b6bba3e4cc6480721e66614c726786761a77ed89da","text":"第三条（与其他法律的关系）除其他法律对鼓励和支持孝道另有特别规定外，本法的规定适用。\n\n第二章 鼓励孝道\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":488,"end":682,"target_id":"77e20952bb974d3423d1bf4cd0aa3fce581f7b2888630af9dcd4eddfce0e0c53","source_hash":"3e7ed13c2a8c3dc6bd2210932cd0861b21b61b521013ac507290270bd3ecbb35","text":"第四条（建立弘扬孝道的基本方案）\n① 卫生福利大臣应当每五年与有关中央行政机关负责人协商制定《促进孝道基本计划》（以下简称“基本计划”）。\n② 基本计划应包括创造鼓励孝道的环境等事项。\n③ 卫生福利大臣可根据《低出生率和老龄化社会基本法》制定低出生率和老龄化社会基本计划时，可将该基本计划纳入其中。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":682,"end":858,"target_id":"9d322f0bc149aa2d6d031c9ee06c429a60a10e7c5a2f8972d1b10a6c3d184478","source_hash":"95bbe0f5e487e6b84b571f361e73cfa2257fc8189502634be23200f0a9c6c37f","text":"第五条（鼓励孝道教育）\n① 国家和地方政府应当努力在幼儿园、小学、初中和高中推行孝道教育。\n② 国家和地方政府应努力在婴幼儿保育中心、社会福利机构、终身教育机构、军队、监狱等场所开展孝道教育。<2011年6月7日修订，2016年2月3日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":858,"end":1074,"target_id":"639cc530ddf90691d8532988577f18d7403d28b51abeef09f982c395b53ea541","source_hash":"d392e538d815100f96a4de81ca80cebd2990ee4d5d71bd88e578f35d7cf48623","text":"第六条（关于赡养父母等家庭状况的调查）\n① 国家和地方政府应当每三年对赡养父母等家庭的实际情况进行调查，确定其需要扶养的情况，并将调查结果公布。\n② 第 1 款规定的实际情况调查可以纳入《老年人福利法》规定的老年人实际情况调查中进行。\n③ 根据第1款进行事实调查和公布结果所需的事项，由卫生福利部条例规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1074,"end":1271,"target_id":"ba0c33202072a14f5af17cf6d3481bd19ebe6ecd6be6305a9f4ffc6007f7b913","source_hash":"21d9deffc2ed5dd38b9d6185e5bf8de023c4717a67c950fe5fecc06d9752d58c","text":"第七条（设立孝道文化促进会）\n① 可以设立孝道文化促进会，以支持和鼓励与促进孝道文化相关的项目和活动。\n孝道文化推广机构应为法人实体。\n③ 除本法对孝文花振兴院另有规定外，民法中有关基金会的规定，照此适用。\n④ 孝道文化促进研究所的设立要求和运作等事项，由卫生福利部条例规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1271,"end":1496,"target_id":"b7014aec85b094982f4b9a26fe1d27bfb18aee7fa2973e2dbe1eb10c81c8789f","source_hash":"8855b235e4062288cfe4603bca4b002b7fff53d892cc7f51c9e73b814224b2da","text":"第八条（孝道文化促进会的职责）孝道文化促进会应当履行下列各款规定的职责。\n1. 孝道文化推广研究调查\n2. 建立综合信息基础设施并提供有关孝道文化推广的信息\n3. 促进孝道文化的教育活动\n4. 孝道文化项目的开发、评估和支持\n5. 孝道文化推广相关专业人员培训\n6. 支持与弘扬孝道文化相关的组织\n7. 卫生福利部条例规定的其他与弘扬孝道文化相关的职责\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1496,"end":1566,"target_id":"e3339781e18a36debddfea9489be18b9e70bf632182ffb3ae8c222e660f7b2db","source_hash":"46c9814f560cd9232845b371ff20cae2c8f5f09f3ec3f1839d96762fba35d51a","text":"第九条（孝月）为了培养社会对孝道的兴趣，并促进儿童的孝道意识，将十月定为孝月。\n\n第三章 孝道支持\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1566,"end":1643,"target_id":"8bd707b0a485cadf37d97e3ae630a025968b41dd3dd96cfbb9939a77865e08b5","source_hash":"db6f54f45783433ed4dd9d8df200dbe31ed7ea97709f4b200001a42f502a92d0","text":"第十条（表彰孝道优秀人士）卫生福利大臣可以选出孝道优秀人士，并给予表彰，以鼓励孝敬父母等。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1643,"end":1726,"target_id":"b85721110a4ede2b943cb781e1c8c4403747b31cfc5010f89e6a8d795711d04e","source_hash":"86ead83e0f45d0e8b4532b0b39d0f54286748228d68621997b251c88760b6cb0","text":"第 11 条（赡养父母等的补助）国家或者地方政府可以向赡养父母等的人提供部分补助，用于支付赡养等所需的费用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1726,"end":1893,"target_id":"cb6eda57c78962d5ff7a2bd7da87191150637c99f7fa8ab9a3ba2c0757f401b5","source_hash":"3e6137549212ab6ce8aa9a8ec3b1e3b4b3d5a6390e32999da5212a8c70166e97","text":"第十二条（为父母等提供住房设施）\n① 国家或地方政府应当鼓励为与子女同住一屋或同一住宅区的父母等提供配备适当设备和功能的居住设施。\n② 国家或地方政府可根据第 1 款向住房设施供应商提供支持。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1893,"end":2011,"target_id":"1010e542a114b72389442403ad1fee26db74e48380deaa51924c1a95d58597a2","source_hash":"07324c9116c86fce1dc8d2794410b077470390164a439e4bc97f2381338479d7","text":"第十三条（对民间组织等的支持）国家和地方政府可以补贴为促进孝道而开展项目的法人团体或个人履行职责所需的全部或部分费用，或者提供必要的支持。\n\n第四章 补充规定\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2011,"end":2079,"target_id":"132364ed0266de2c01620f3d9f71383e3b09a68b8ac2344c4f2f71e202ba196f","source_hash":"aaf5da4bbac5ee88069ef405b70eee93506a9ed59e0651d84fd6b1d864982ca0","text":"第十四条（禁止使用类似名称）除根据本法设立的孝文花振兴院外，不得使用“孝文花振兴院”或任何类似名称。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2079,"end":2305,"target_id":"c306b9973ad06d30093b113e8c8bd985989aae0f516f52400d9572726aac8578","source_hash":"25dd162adc059b409bac3bcc419af2f13f301989f8c0f493636244107cf3cc88","text":"第十五条（行政罚款）\n① 任何人违反第十四条关于禁止使用相似名称的规定，将被处以不超过三百万韩元的行政罚款。\n② 第1款规定的行政罚款，由卫生福利部长官或特别自治市市长、特别自治省知事、市长、县长或区长（指自治区区长）按照总统令规定征收。<2017年12月12日修订>\n③ 删除 <2017.12.12>\n④ 删除 <2017.12.12>\n⑤ 删除 <2017.12.12>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2305,"end":2356,"target_id":"1a586036edc5c501ec7326e6353c3bc94a639ca4f29eadfff92193675aee68b7","source_hash":"3d3da56b7c9d5f44dfd2a779fd8c7fee3addce394096fb9e1ef54926c689a625","text":"补充规定 <第8610号，2007年8月3日>\n\n本法自公布之日起一年后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2356,"end":2387,"target_id":"bb30852d13da6d3fee4981bbb83862a9dd85061f4362b0e37d8df3c8827baa77","source_hash":"164e810c80a4aef8802662b4202625296701c282320dab6b0d9a0e8e3c610c2f","text":"补充条款（婴幼儿照护法）<第10789号，2011年6月7日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2387,"end":2434,"target_id":"101da2b3de5193fe11399cf6f2313db6fb4e8f127bd273edbdc4f6df7b4b5897","source_hash":"7172cc4526b19c95db24e19764f4986d5189e2c90036101ff4ce5f11bcad947d","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2434,"end":2451,"target_id":"2864772684047713e9c00c7a20b6c88ac513979113628a382fc3c5ddd372c4b5","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2451,"end":2563,"target_id":"07449459b28c05bd17d7abee6fff9fdaea1007dff1889a84294e445f8dad3804","source_hash":"dce6ab4970dacf1d5b6ad04c8e90640a11f70f8f30c42196a09b7516ede8fd2a","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<31> 已省略\n\n  《促进和支持孝道法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第五条第二款中，“婴幼儿保育机构”应改为“婴幼儿日托中心”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2563,"end":2616,"target_id":"6242e8253e33b8701d793ca75f85a05c5adbd59f7e70bb0c7665ac0ee9bfaf36","source_hash":"ec107ef6763674b5a6fdec1f3903f4e43e251e2c7d8308055f7c10f59212dfe4","text":"补充规定 <第14014号，2016年2月3日>\n\n本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010509-199536-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2616,"end":2659,"target_id":"b53d79322b5e67ba52687cb55e3fec976cffa194712c9649e57f6d291f8582dc","source_hash":"5c2fd8b5ee5b05d0c0a28b34b226e9403534b10e7ac087ca2ad773fc914e9c59","text":"补充规定 <第15190号，2017年12月12日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":21,"target_id":"0dc5d3c56ad3ea435528d285fa39469fedece1acfac4308e6b8ca578f5e09026","source_hash":"b450ee3500d799f4273c0dc09c43f3d63804a3e3f62c719fbe85acfd2a16c9bb","text":"《促进和支持孝道法》实施细则"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":72,"target_id":"d9b25bc7618f9b803432174dc4179a82bb851441739559fb1861cc24fd97a0e5","source_hash":"33b08f9a06f82fe655d5c32361155a224c5bb320b4169c030ebcf103d6cbb4f0","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定《促进和支持孝道法》所委托的事项以及为实施该法所必需的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":72,"end":235,"target_id":"e2174f3e9520503bdefb671d62d4b15a8845104da3e2f8357301aa89eaced88d","source_hash":"2eaae428ee15517441c551d77c9ca3bab53dcc97c86a213dc3cd6192736fd08c","text":"第二条（制定孝道基本计划）  卫生福利大臣依据《孝道促进支援法》（以下简称“本法”）第四条第一款制定或修改《孝道基本计划》时，应当通知有关中央行政机关和地方政府的负责人。<2008年12月31日修订；2010年3月15日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":235,"end":348,"target_id":"7fbcfe44fdd93540697843f6a4ace9de14352c39217296b84b8faa8ad0763eb9","source_hash":"5657bc065df98f880881fd5d6c971754bf85b3ccc7c195e3b6dcfacdf13092a7","text":"第三条（行政罚款的征收标准）根据本法第十五条第一款规定征收的行政罚款，由特别自治市市长、特别自治省省长、市长、县长或区长（指自治区区长）按照附表所列的征收标准征收。<2018年4月24日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":348,"end":398,"target_id":"5823ae32a31fe21ea7296b3b77563aec8c7a942caa69c4f719d43d2c06bd7f15","source_hash":"b4ddcbfe0aa6b04047f28027575a5422a94e0c37c005808616dfef4680566a5d","text":"补充规定 <第20614号，2008年2月20日>\n\n本法令自2008年8月4日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":398,"end":441,"target_id":"2814a35528229ef66c753a40f8255be9aef8c521fa5df5e09b87fde6bf3b7585","source_hash":"0d029278af8265dcb73fcdb5db4fa222c22c4392090c42360aebadbf9711a160","text":"增编（内政安全部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2008年12月31日，第21214号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":441,"end":478,"target_id":"d5c3ef60536122717e7c6fa49dd77df1a38f3dcf01ba016b6bee56001e7e88dc","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":478,"end":495,"target_id":"2f12e5899e3ebdaca1c59452725c54849ce92af42e7517956df7e60e7fcae718","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第2至4条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":495,"end":576,"target_id":"bb33d276c95bb189d296f393270148f64b844f6bb1ea7380011be4be66e82139","source_hash":"12f7d63fc09afc7f727e8652e08936d4d1e41a439296836c6f929123c9089e04","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<142> 已省略\n\n  《促进和支持孝道法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":576,"end":689,"target_id":"bd289e51295fa45eae1901a260eb3db47c28ba6d2c0a9bda08848a218665884f","source_hash":"f864b9b556eca7c4c21db62665d982e806159373ea52f669c2968becf4b07f28","text":"  在第二条和第三条第一款中，“卫生福利大臣”应改为“卫生、福利及家庭事务大臣”。\n\n  第三条第三款中的“卫生福利部条例”应改为“卫生福利家庭部条例”。\n\n  <144> 至 <175> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00011","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":689,"end":731,"target_id":"8aab1a4a04fb1c3caf374e897b40b246c7d1bfd5eab8913dbbdd120bf68b1171","source_hash":"4ff98e24fe6d7987e4d11f7cc59b89fce754cc4283f68c3a2221af5c7ef859d0","text":"增编（卫生福利部及其附属机构的组织结构）<22075号，2010年3月15日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00012","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":731,"end":775,"target_id":"ffe771dc3faee0ba59275cd2182177a9fa9d65d37e2ff1a768889d0b76f4bc0d","source_hash":"961e5695798ce6c6d181c1e5c14cc76abeb7727aa87865b741def818755ea17d","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2010年3月19日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00013","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":775,"end":856,"target_id":"de2a09633810e5a83fcf2f5a0b0d228dcaf256aa7a06d1b5dd823e4a614ebea4","source_hash":"9f7f92dcd83fbbe1dadff3f3f36d0d0d93f7f86d766fe92d9ecfd74cad730272","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至<185> 已省略\n\n  《促进和支持孝道法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00014","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":856,"end":957,"target_id":"49e754b3c2cff4e75a919f58ad5e38e5d6733bda9954ebe48fd4ef3e0b9d5548","source_hash":"c35982513bbb04bb12708fd58b05958be0e7f47f78702fc5a17223e786f73c1d","text":"  在第二条和第三条第一款中，“卫生、福利和家庭事务大臣”应改为“卫生和福利大臣”。\n\n  第三条第三款中的“卫生福利家庭部条例”应改为“卫生福利部条例”。\n\n  <187> 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00015","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":957,"end":1002,"target_id":"489139de980cee100da405a7f55694e891ded299596285acf6cf6e2223574f28","source_hash":"c719f4902b02901809c25d3e0210a45802903a0b9596e937a48f0c2f1d35def8","text":"补充规定 <第28454号，2017年11月28日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00016","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1002,"end":2770,"target_id":"3fb66708a632a0e9e79aac9dec25e4b35f69d4b5610f5a906f1fb6cdf220eddd","source_hash":"a1a8b5affe3f63fa7611c10bc5226b3f1156efe4142b843e735d35548b66b1f0","text":"补充规定 <第28825号，2018年4月24日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n行政罚款的适用标准（与第三条相关）\n[星号] <新增于 2017. 11. 28.>\n\n  行政罚款的适用标准（与第三条相关）                                                   \n\n  1. 通用标准                                                                     \n\n   A. 根据违规次数增加行政罚款的标准是，过去三年中发生的违规行为与之前相同。   \n\n  本规定适用于已收到上述处罚令的情况。在这种情况下，期限的计算依据是违规行为的严重程度。       \n\n  关于上述情况，收到行政罚款处分通知书的日期以及在该处分后再次发生相同违规行为的日期         \n\n  它是根据检测日期计算的。                                                 \n\n   B. 在依据A款规定处以加重处罚的情况下，加重处罚的适用顺序即为违规行为。   \n\n  上述先前处罚决定的数量（如果根据A款规定，在期限内有两项或两项以上行政罚款处罚决定）        \n\n  ，它指的是更高阶的订单，并被设置为下一订单。                             \n\n   C. 在下列任何情况下，征收机关应根据第2款规定收取行政罚款金额。   \n\n  罚款金额可能减少一半。但是，对于行政罚款拖欠的违规行为，       \n\n  此规定不适用于儿童。                                                \n\n    1）如果违反《公共秩序违法行为管制法》实施令第2条第2款第1项任何子款规定的行为人，则适用本规定。   \n\n  如果适用于我                                                              \n\n    2) 如果违规行为被认定为由于轻微疏忽或错误所致                \n\n    3) 被认可为已努力纠正或解决违法行为   \n\n  ，则                                                                       \n\n    4) 此外，考虑到违规程度、违规动机及其后果等，需要减轻处罚    \n\n  在必要时                                                     \n\n   D. 依据第2款规定，处罚机关应考虑违法行为的程度、违法动机及其后果等因素。  \n\n  根据该法第十五条第一款的规定，行政罚款金额可以增加二分之一。但是，     \n\n  行政罚款金额不得超过  规定的上限。                                      \n\n  2. 个别标准                                                                     \n\n  （单位：10,000 韩元）                                                                    \n\n┌───────────────┬──────┬────────────────┐\n\n│위반행위                      │근거 법조문 │과태료 금액                     │\n\n│                              │            ├────┬────┬──────┤\n\n"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00001","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647893","source_hash":"371305a74e0a2c58c91567d2971a56b55520a0001451ac0e873d9ab4ac9bc468","text":"[星号] <新增于 2017. 11. 28.>"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00002","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647894","source_hash":"d2ed2353638c9b5e4466fafce751f6808f162fdb1e9e4d59ef5d832fe7a5f216","text":"行政罚款的适用标准（与第三条相关）"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00003","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647895","source_hash":"a617cf3ccc65ba6af0228b05b78c02b61364dbd74e669da8ea55dab0e5a320b6","text":"1. 通用标准"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00004","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647896","source_hash":"b4e42dfe994d178fd9756f34dd1805566ec8e4ff8be40d83a5885b85cc733463","text":"a. 根据违规次数增加行政罚款的标准是，过去三年中发生的违规行为与之前相同。"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00005","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647897","source_hash":"bc341af6c84d35508e1b868718b26e3847b21ef22d3bdb9a7cc6910d9253844b","text":"本规定适用于已收到处罚令的情况。在这种情况下，期限的计算取决于违规行为的严重程度。"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00006","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647898","source_hash":"a8df4eb03f04f0a4c80e259c5f0bcc9b7ecc25882ff492de4b52db2319a5d673","text":"关于上述情况，罚款日期与该处罚后再次发生相同违规行为的日期相符。"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00007","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647899","source_hash":"02ed300090532946b4f77cdc35184df4cb2de7e4eef22fe567a26d3d4ed878b4","text":"根据检测日期。"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00008","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647900","source_hash":"c92e1a0688ede8589c73b8b38a31e3c693a83e233a3a98f33264447d19d0b1f3","text":"b. 在依据第a项规定作出加重处罚的案件中，加重处罚的适用顺序为违法行为。"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00009","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647901","source_hash":"8144ed94900789110df23f16d2b98c5d5a3ca7cc89b6a45252d7bd76d345c14d","text":"先前处罚令的数量（如果在根据第 (a) 款规定的期间内有两项或两项以上行政罚款处罚令）"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00010","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647902","source_hash":"7e33293731ce353e2e95c0e9a80168aa37dc653bea45d77d051a91a07e151c1a","text":"，它指的是更高的订单，并生成下一个订单。"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00011","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647903","source_hash":"5c2955a2649364eb074fbdd74d65f34d115f4cc055fe775c83188534faa01ec1","text":"。在下列任何情况下，处罚机关应当按照第2款规定处以行政罚款。"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00012","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647904","source_hash":"9061a8b311496dd241a316777471da4e72f11a07124166a6286a9412b3f3a05d","text":"罚款金额可能减少至原金额的一半。但是，对于行政罚款拖欠的违规行为，"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00013","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647905","source_hash":"2091f8fec00dbcb78b0e886f088bb05d2a90beda775622c0f39abbe46746a176","text":"和"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00014","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647906","source_hash":"e52971ee7e80dae2a0cd38decedc34e40114e7b9369eaa2aea0d8bcdf786a7e1","text":"1) 如果违反《公共秩序违法行为管制法》实施令第2条第2款第1项任何子款的[主体]"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00015","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647907","source_hash":"b394beeca550a591b4830c1b172db530c8413c223fe8dc8d39e9f658db153bd0","text":"如果它对应于我"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00016","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647908","source_hash":"6ec56c642de8197effa0eeca8cede8d63f53b71daf7820b31e5629d1cb5d6726","text":"2) 如果违规行为被认定为由于轻微疏忽或错误所致"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00017","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647909","source_hash":"6092172969cb7f12e97e26fa1bafc8bf7899d35094449ef6f2417365e536b6e8","text":"3) 被认可为已努力纠正或解决违法状态"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00018","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647910","source_hash":"ba1f63344196196d8e53bbd56867c2922dccc849179e6110c15a14d6ab312bfc","text":"案例"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00019","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647911","source_hash":"860ebd246a909dda9f75422400d3fbb82c9772c6f8572c76201babc8605cc36f","text":"此外，考虑到违法行为的程度、违法动机及其后果，可以减轻刑罚。"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00020","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647912","source_hash":"aeb3dd7ddd6b8c6a57378b8ca6c88b205790b03a1bf7cd488889651ba0f47655","text":"在必要时"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00021","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647913","source_hash":"4969ef768b6b02906e3012594298d0ba98302f1aeb4a0dfb894e103b472c00da","text":"d. 依据第2款规定，处罚机关应考虑违法行为的程度、违法动机及其后果等因素。"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00022","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647914","source_hash":"d5cbe61e2aff0ea135486434277b86809fa1ce06f60a3f4de53210b1066674e4","text":"根据该法第十五条第一款规定，行政罚款金额可以增加二分之一。但是，"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00023","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647915","source_hash":"1b8619782bb69bb502fee1e12f0091e5e4822fbaa80f2ccc917e69a118285eee","text":"行政罚款金额不得超过  规定的上限。"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00024","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647916","source_hash":"1d6f6bce78138ea58d3cc062dbce45c849d57266d25052a404c84318174a0c95","text":"2. 单个标准"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00025","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647917","source_hash":"48266d53f26f1d052cd0f43f502bc9a1625a0add24b355fe20ac1d61152871ca","text":"(单位：10,000 韩元)"},{"id":"A36235-zh-00026","doc":"A36235","law_id":"kr-010658-203319-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2647918","source_hash":"903aa577eae3314c52694d